                    {
                        "sense_id": "7f8fa17f-760b-3d6a-b4f9-5215c7afd474",
                        "entry_id": "37fb8a3f-9309-3912-b620-b15761f0caed",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A person who is opposed to the practice or mandate of wearing masks."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "neologism"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5c6cfaaa-9de1-4e38-b11d-10e0418a898b",
                                "sense_id": "7f8fa17f-760b-3d6a-b4f9-5215c7afd474",
                                "text": "On one side of the argument was a woman named Claire Newbourne, an anti-masker, a member of a group opposed to the government regulations on Marburg."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "70f54147-c592-4d99-9169-b97a1e028b2c",
                                "sense_id": "7f8fa17f-760b-3d6a-b4f9-5215c7afd474",
                                "text": "Every time a citizen disobeys mask rules by not wearing one, or wearing it incorrectly, they endanger essential workers who have already risked their lives to service them in restaurant, store, and many other public settings. In an odd way, anti-maskers see this as being patriotic."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e40bac58-378f-4997-b5b8-3f41cd30847c",
                                "sense_id": "7f8fa17f-760b-3d6a-b4f9-5215c7afd474",
                                "text": "Beightol, who is the administrator for several Facebook pages where public schools teachers can vent, said educators fall into three categories: vocal pro-maskers, vocal anti-maskers and pro-maskers who stay out of the line of fire."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
