                        "sense_id": "e8ed401a-2ee2-3a76-92b1-63b603eb5bee",
                        "entry_id": "02a96057-6d3a-3ef9-b210-1e33a793b1af",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Alternative form of antimasquer."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "alt-of",
                            "alternative"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "91805b83-198b-4e78-8b40-c7821e1f2bea",
                                "sense_id": "e8ed401a-2ee2-3a76-92b1-63b603eb5bee",
                                "text": "The antimaskers are not at all concerned in the action; they are led into fill up the intervals with a grotesque kind of merriment, or, their grotesque dances, and then sink into nothing."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3a2e0ac9-8cdc-48f8-815a-e5caf49122ac",
                                "sense_id": "e8ed401a-2ee2-3a76-92b1-63b603eb5bee",
                                "text": "Then came groups of antimaskers giving a mirthful variety to the scene of splendor — a company of beggars riding on lean jades, another of birds, but, most popular of all with the civic Puritans who lined the streets, a mask satirizing those projectors who begged the illegal and unpopular patents of monopoly from the King."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
